{%- comment -%}
  Designed "Leather Care Guide" page body (handle: leather-care-guide).
  Ported 1:1 from docs/mockups/page-care.html; styling = .kv-cp.
  Image on Shopify Files: care-patina.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign img_patina = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0267/9164/1277/files/care-patina.png?v=1782214499&width=900' -%}

<div class="kv-cp">

  <section class="phead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Leather Care</span>
      <h1>Care for it, and it lasts a lifetime.</h1>
      <p>Genuine leather is a living material — it breathes, flexes, and develops a beautiful patina over time. A little care keeps your Kordovan piece looking better with every year.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead"><span class="eyebrow">The Essentials</span><h2>Your care routine, at a glance.</h2></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
        <h4>Every Day</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Wipe with a soft, dry cloth after use to remove dust and moisture</li>
          <li>Let wet leather dry naturally — never a hair dryer or heater</li>
          <li>Keep out of prolonged direct sunlight</li>
          <li>Avoid sharp objects and rough surfaces</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.9 4.9l2.8 2.8M16.3 16.3l2.8 2.8M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.9 19.1l2.8-2.8M16.3 7.7l2.8-2.8"/></svg>
        <h4>Every 4–6 Weeks</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Apply a small amount of quality leather conditioner with a soft cloth</li>
          <li>Work in small circular motions, then buff off any excess</li>
          <li>Conditioning keeps leather supple and prevents cracking</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 7h18v13H3z"/><path d="M3 7l3-4h12l3 4M12 11v5"/></svg>
        <h4>When Storing</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Store in a cool, dry place away from humidity</li>
          <li>Use a dust bag or breathable cotton cover — never plastic</li>
          <li>Stuff bags with tissue paper to hold their shape</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec sec--parch"><div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split__img"><img src="{{ img_patina }}" alt="Veg-tan leather darkened to a warm patina with age" loading="lazy" width="900" height="1125"></div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Embrace the Patina</span>
      <h2>The marks make it yours.</h2>
      <p>Our veg-tan and full-grain leathers are meant to darken and develop character over time. The scratches, the colour deepening, the softening — these aren't flaws.</p>
      <p>They're the leather recording your life. This is what makes each piece uniquely yours, and no conditioner can buy it — only time and use.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead"><span class="eyebrow">Golden Rules</span><h2>Do this, never that.</h2></div>
    <div class="dual">
      <div class="dual__c dual--do">
        <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Do</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Condition every 4–6 weeks to replenish natural oils</li>
          <li>Let wet leather air-dry at room temperature</li>
          <li>Store in a breathable dust bag in a cool, dry place</li>
          <li>Treat scuffs gently — most fade into the patina</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="dual__c dual--dont">
        <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>Don't</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Use chemical cleaners, alcohol, or acetone — they strip the finish</li>
          <li>Soak or submerge leather in water</li>
          <li>Store in plastic or humid spaces — leather must breathe</li>
          <li>Fold or crease bags for long periods</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec sec--parch"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="shead"><span class="eyebrow">Know Your Leather</span><h2>Care by material.</h2></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><h4>Full-Grain</h4><p>The most durable, breathable hide — it keeps the natural grain, resists moisture, and ages most gracefully. Condition lightly; let it patina.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h4>Vegetable-Tanned</h4><p>Tanned with natural plant extracts. It darkens dramatically with sun and use — lean into it, and condition to keep it supple.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h4>Crazy Horse</h4><p>A waxed full-grain finish that shows light scratches by design. Rub a mark with your finger and it blends back in — that's the character.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="sec sec--tight"><div class="wrap"><div class="contact">
    <div>
      <h3>Caring for a specific piece?</h3>
      <p>Tell us what you've got and we'll share the exact routine.<br>WhatsApp +92 333 2601161 · kordovan.official@gmail.com</p>
    </div>
    <a class="fwa" href="https://wa.me/923332601161" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.5 15.3L2 22l4.8-1.5A10 10 0 1 0 12 2z" fill="#fff"/></svg>Chat on WhatsApp</a>
  </div></div></section>

</div>
